# Environment variables

## Local (.env)

```env
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"
JWT_SECRET="your-long-random-secret"
```

## Vercel (Settings → Environment Variables)

| Key | Value | Notes |
|-----|--------|--------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | `file:./dev.db` | **Must be this exact SQLite path.** If Vercel auto-set a `postgres://...` URL, edit/replace it. |
| `JWT_SECRET` | long random string | Required for login cookies |

You can leave `POSTGRES_URL` / `PRISMA_DATABASE_URL` unused — this app uses **SQLite**, seeded during `npm run build` on Vercel.
